{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## S03 · 5 Run three instances\n*Guide: Step 5.*",
      "id": "class_s03_runs_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### ⚠ Feedback from the engine\n{{fbRuns}}",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=fbRuns = null or fbRuns = \"\""
      },
      "id": "class_s03_runs_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_runs_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Done when\n- a completed **certificate** instance issued a certificate (CERT-...) and notified only the student\n- a completed **postponement** instance was approved, registered and notified the student and the instructor\n- a completed **recognition** instance was rejected, has a letter and notified only the student",
      "id": "class_s03_runs_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "separator",
      "id": "class_s03_runs_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Questions\nLook at the highlighted path of each instance in Operate.",
      "id": "class_s03_runs_5"
    },
    {
      "type": "checklist",
      "key": "cpPost",
      "label": "1. Which notification tasks did instance 2 (postponement, approved) pass?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Notify student",
          "value": "student"
        },
        {
          "label": "Notify instructor",
          "value": "instructor"
        },
        {
          "label": "Notify registrar",
          "value": "registrar"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_runs_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "cpRec",
      "label": "2. How many branches did instance 3 (recognition, rejected) take at the inclusive gateway?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "One",
          "value": "one"
        },
        {
          "label": "Two",
          "value": "two"
        },
        {
          "label": "Three",
          "value": "three"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_runs_7"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s03-runs",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
